    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:source-pages_homeschool_homeschoolrequirementspage.when_you_upload_a_pdf_or_csv_ollama_extr",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "When you upload a PDF or CSV, Ollama extracts the criteria once and caches them. Re-uploading the same file skips Ollama entirely (checksum match). A different file triggers re-extraction. Pre-seeded state sets were hand-authored and are always instant. Sets expire annually — you'll see a warning near the expiry date."
    },
    {
      "@id": "entity:target-pages_homeschool_homeschoolrequirementspage.when_you_upload_a_pdf_or_csv_ollama_extr-v1",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "prov:value": "当您上传PDF或CSV时，Ollama会提取标准一次并缓存它们。重新上传同一个文件将跳过Ollama（检查和匹配）。不同的文件会触发重新提取。预先设置的状态集是手动编写的，永远都是即时的。状态集每年到期 — 您将在到期日附近看到警告。",
      "generated_by": {
        "@id": "activity:translation-pages_homeschool_homeschoolrequirementspage.when_you_upload_a_pdf_or_csv_ollama_extr-2026-05-31T23:26:54.904332+00:00"
